The Scheme &amp;quot;National Disabled Finance and Development Corporation&amp;quot;, launched by the Department of Social Justice and Empowerment, Government of Himachal Pradesh, aims to make Persons with Disabilities self-reliant by providing loans for self-employment through the Himachal Pradesh Minority Finance and Development Corporation.
